00:06:09.667 --> 00:06:10.834
♪ Merci ♪

00:06:10.834 --> 00:06:15.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.133
♪ But for now I bid you ♪

00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:20.634
♪ Adieu, adieu ♪

00:06:20.634 --> 00:06:23.267
♪ Adieu ♪

00:06:23.267 --> 00:06:24.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:24.534 --> 00:06:27.868
We have a great show tonight!

00:06:27.868 --> 00:06:31.200
Marlon Wayans is here!

